    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "To be honest, no. I haven’t used AI for this specific purpose. My approach to difficult subjects has always been through traditional means or avoiding them altogether. While I’m open to new tools, especially with my high openness score, the barrier of anxiety around math itself prevents me from experimenting with these technologies in that domain.",
